<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  <%= @event.name %> rejected your invoice "<%= @invoice.name %>" for
  <%= @invoice.amount.format(with_currency: true) %>, so it won't be paid.
</p>

<p><strong>Reason from <%= @invoice.reviewed_by&.name || @event.name %>:</strong></p>

<blockquote>
  <%= simple_format h(@invoice.rejection_reason) %>
</blockquote>

<p>
  Once you've addressed this, you can
  <%= link_to "submit a new invoice on HCB", my_pay_url %>.
  If you have any questions, just reply to this email.
</p>

<p>
  Sincerely,
  <br><br>
  The HCB Team
</p>
